    <string name="analysis_overview_screen_measurement_activity_same_isf">What counts: pure corrections only; the strength of the drop after insulin is compared, with activity before the correction, against days without it. Food and activity inside the window rule out a pure ISF estimate.</string>
    <string name="analysis_overview_screen_measurement_activity_same_effective">What counts: completed meal + IOB/bolus chains. The residual drop relative to the model is divided by the expected insulin contribution; activity is searched from 6 hours before the start to the end of the episode. This is a combined effective response (including muscle glucose uptake), not a proven pure ISF.</string>

